@startuml
title Formal-first stack-safety evidence flow

skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam ArrowColor #455A64
skinparam ArrowThickness 1.5
skinparam defaultFontName Helvetica
skinparam activity {
  BackgroundColor #FFF59D
  BorderColor #F9A825
  FontColor #102027
  DiamondBackgroundColor #ECEFF1
  DiamondBorderColor #455A64
}

start
:Exact source revision and\npgmcp/libcpg SCC discovery; <<#FFF59D>>
:Corroborate recursive equations,\nobservables, lifecycle, and false positives; <<#FFF59D>>
:Rocq · TLA+/TLC · SMT model\nwith no proof escapes; <<#FFCDD2>>
:Extract every invariant into\nproperties and causal required-red controls; <<#E1BEE7>>
:Implement the specialized typed\nheap-resident machine; <<#B2DFDB>>
:Run 100,000-level / 256-KiB tests,\nwork · allocation · RSS · malformed gates; <<#C8E6C9>>
if (All acceptance gates green?) then (yes)
  :Bind ledger rows to immutable commit; <<#C8E6C9>>
  :Run fresh full-source pgmcp/libcpg\nrecursion and SCC analysis; <<#BBDEFB>>
  if (Every result has exact disposition?) then (yes)
    :Attach hashes and trusted evidence\nto pgmcp; <<#C8E6C9>>
    stop
  else (no)
    :Return uncovered source edge\nto formal modeling before another implementation revision; <<#FFCDD2>>
    stop
  endif
else (no)
  :Minimize the counterexample and\nstrengthen the formal invariant before another implementation revision; <<#FFCDD2>>
  stop
endif
@enduml
